{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:13.10.380","page_type":"section"},"citation":"13.10.380","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.10.380","content_hash":"b65e146e2ffc531ed672aa98af2d3c15bb79e4a544b436e78a53076bd54fe71e","heading":"Hydrant meter – Permit required.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.10.380:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.10.380","text":"A hydrant meter permit is hereby required before installation of a hydrant meter. The permit shall be issued by the Water Division after the following conditions are met by the permit applicant:\n(a) Submit completed hydrant meter permit application;\n(b) Provide payment in full of the applicable deposits and fees; and\n(c) Provide payment in full of any delinquent amounts due to Water Division for customer’s account. (Ord. 18650 § 4, 6-6-06; Ord. 17155 § 2, 8-12-97. Code 1995 § 146-105.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"51502e1b-f606-53d7-b6cc-d6a7322e3843"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"13.10.380","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.10.380","content_hash":"5d146fe7dfa6b3ec094bebc40e2f7baa4741069db233601f597f91e06f2db2cc","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.10.380:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.10.380:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.10.380","text":"A hydrant meter permit is hereby required before installation of a hydrant meter. The permit shall be issued by the Water Division after the following conditions are met by the permit applicant:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"15d150aa-d3db-5311-b5e1-e84054a20055"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"13.10.380","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.10.380","content_hash":"2b2895ff715c22a711968840ac86201506e4f945573dd3f81f6209f7a02d573c","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.10.380:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.10.380:block:1","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.10.380","text":"(a) Submit completed hydrant meter permit application;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"46ef1e87-dd60-593c-bd77-7ed210c5ecbf"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"13.10.380","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.10.380","content_hash":"7fce74a7eeb87bdb023d9e46a0fad6ad8c52163d71b30ff6ea3b1b462f4eed7c","heading":null,"ordinal":2,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.10.380:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.10.380:block:2","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.10.380","text":"(b) Provide payment in full of the applicable deposits and fees; and","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"4791424b-5c36-525f-9e35-3d6167b799e6"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"13.10.380","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.10.380","content_hash":"59af1941fc5578998ea84500fdd244a855bfa2f0d1c5a8f0afc8df80afa5baee","heading":null,"ordinal":3,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.10.380:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.10.380:block:3","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.10.380","text":"(c) Provide payment in full of any delinquent amounts due to Water Division for customer’s account. (Ord. 18650 § 4, 6-6-06; Ord. 17155 § 2, 8-12-97. Code 1995 § 146-